tes><pos x="120" y="700" /></visualElement><visualElement><elementName>Rectangle</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Label</string><string>2. หน่วยความจำข้อมูลและระบบส่งผลลัพธ์ (rRAM 256x8 &amp; Result Streaming)</string></entry><entry><string>RectWidth</string><int>46</int></entry><entry><string>RectHeight</string><int>66</int></entry><entry><string>textFontSize</string><int>22</int></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="60" y="1020" /></visualElement><visualElement><elementName>Rectangle</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Label</string><string>3. วงจรควบคุมสถานะและรีจิสเตอร์คำสั่ง (CPU Core FSM &amp; Instruction Register)</string></entry><entry><string>RectWidth</string><int>46</int></entry><entry><string>RectHeight</string><int>50</int></entry><entry><string>textFontSize</string><int>22</int></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="1040" y="80" /></visualElement><visualElement><elementName>Rectangle</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Label</string><string>5. ตัวนับคำสั่งและระบบกระโดด (Program Counter PC &amp; Branch Logic)</string></entry><entry><string>RectWidth</string><int>46</int></entry><entry><string>RectHeight</string><int>44</int></entry><entry><string>textFontSize</string><int>22</int></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="1040" y="1120" /></visualElement><visualElement><elementName>Rectangle</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Label</string><string>6A. กลุ่มรีจิสเตอร์หลัก (Primary Registers: SP, regD, regC, accB)</string></entry><entry><string>RectWidth</string><int>45</int></entry><entry><string>RectHeight</string><int>45</int></entry><entry><string>textFontSize</string><int>22</int></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="2020" y="80" /></visualElement><visualElement><elementName>Rectangle</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Label</string><string>7. หน่วยคำนวณและตรรกะ (ALU: Add, Sub, Mul 4-bit, And, Or, Xor, Not)</string></entry><entry><string>RectWidth</string><int>45</int></entry><entry><string>RectHeight</string><int>36</int></entry><entry><string>textFontSize</string><int>22</int></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="2020" y="1020" /></visualElement><visualElement><elementName>Rectangle</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Label</string><string>8. ตัวเปรียบเทียบ แฟล็ก และตารางจำนวนเฉพาะ (Comparator, Flags &amp; isPrime ROM)</string></entry><entry><string>RectWidth</string><int>45</int></entry><entry><string>RectHeight</string><int>25</int></entry><entry><string>textFontSize</string><int>22</int></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="2020" y="1740" /></visualElement><visualElement><elementName>Rectangle</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Label</string><string>6B. วงจรรวบรวมผลลัพธ์ของสะสม (Accumulator accA MUX &amp; Datapath Matrix)</string></entry><entry><string>RectWidth</string><int>111</int></entry><entry><string>RectHeight</string><int>32</int></entry><entry><string>textFontSize</string><int>22</int></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="360" y="2400" /></visualElement><visualElement><elementName>Rectangle</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Label</string><string>4. วงจรถอดรหัสคำสั่ง (Opcode Decoder)</string></entry><entry><string>RectWidth</string><int>20</int></entry><entry><string>RectHeight</string><int>75</int></entry><entry><string>textFontSize</string><int>22</int></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="2960" y="80" /></visualElement><visualElement><elementName>Rectangle</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Label</string><string>9. วงจรคำนวณ ห.ร.ม. 12 สเตจ (GCD Accelerator)</string></entry><entry><string>RectWidth</string><int>20</int></entry><entry><string>RectHeight</string><int>95</int></entry><entry><string>textFontSize</string><int>22</int></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="3400" y="80" /></visualElement><visualElement><elementName>Rectangle</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Label</string><string>10. วงจรคำนวณฟีโบนัชชี 16 บิต (Fibonacci Accelerator)</string></entry><entry><string>RectWidth</string><int>24</in